Models
------

Model weights are licensed separately from this code and are downloaded at
runtime under their own terms. The default model, LaMa, is Apache-2.0. Other
models IOPaint can fetch may be more restrictive — for example the RemoveBG
model `briaai/RMBG-1.4` is released for non-commercial use only. Review the
license of any model you enable before relying on its output.

See the "License" section of README.md for a summary.
